  "trace_scope": "Monotonic timestamps on official GX RPC returns, delivered notifications and SQLite statements that set a child terminal flag. Turn-start is suppressed only in the two lost-start runs. A separate ordinary run reproduced the same denials with no suppression.",
  "codex_source": "vendor/codex/codex-rs/app-server/src/request_processors/thread_lifecycle.rs::set_thread_status_and_interrupt_stale_turns projects in-progress turns to interrupted when the loaded thread is not active. The request rewrites only status. A real TurnAbortedEvent in app-server-protocol/src/protocol/thread_history.rs::handle_turn_aborted records its completion time when supplied.",
  "fix": "3a9423c9ba4c0cff2c60e74b17235a4d11e5f47c is a separate child-recovery commit. A real completion event, completion time or exact saved terminal receipt establishes the terminal boundary."
